d pending validation.*\n\n## Annex 10-B. Gawad KALASAG Criteria and IAT Crosswalk\n\n**Table 10.26**\n\n*Gawad KALASAG CY 2026 Criteria Mapped to IAT Domains*\n\n| **Criterion (OCD Memo No. 763, S. 2026)** | **Indicators** | **Weight** | **Related IAT Domains and Manual Chapters**                                       |\n|-------------------------------------------|----------------|------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| I. Structure                              | 9              | 25%        | A1 (legal mandate, Council), A2 (organisation, staffing); Chapters 1 and 2        |\n| II\\. Competency                           | 12             | 35%        | A2.6, A7 (training, drills, BDRRMCs), B7.2–B7.3; Chapters 2 and 9                 |\n| III\\. Management System                   | 13             | 15%        | A3–A6, A8, B1–B6 (planning, finance, warning, response, EOC); Chapters 3, 4 and 6 |\n| IV\\. Enabling Policies                    | 1              | 5%         | A1.5 (local DRRM issuances); Chapter 1                                            |\n| V. Knowledge Management and Advocacy      | 2              | 10%        | A5 (risk data, event database), A6.6 (IEC), A10.9; Chapters 3, 7 and 9            |\n| VI\\. Partnership and Participation        | 2              | 10%        | A10.1, A10.2, Part C; Chapter 8                                                   |\n\n*Note. Criteria, indicator counts and weights from OCD Memo No. 763, s. 2026, section 5.1. The mapping to IAT domains is this chapter''s own, made to share evidence; it is approximate and does not reproduce the official assessment tool, whose indicators are to be read from the LDRRMCO Assessment Tool for the year.*\n\n## Annex 10-C. Leadership Transition Pack Contents\n\n**Table 10.27**\n\n*Contents of the Transition Pack (SOP 10-02)*\n\n| **No.** | **Item**                   | **Content**                                                  