             | CDRRMO Head                        |             |\n| 3       | Source code repository, with City owner access                                      | City ICT office                    |             |\n| 4       | Hosting accounts (database, sign-in, storage, web hosting), billing and keys        | City ICT office                    |             |\n| 5       | Domain and DNS records                                                              | City ICT office                    |             |\n| 6       | Runbooks: deployment, backup and restore, ICT asset register                        | City ICT office                    |             |\n| 7       | IAT workbook, Traceability and Data Dictionary, Methodology                         | CDRRMO Research and Planning       |             |\n| 8       | Training materials and recordings                                                   | CDRRMO Administration and Training |             |\n| 9       | Restore test performed by City staff alone                                          | City ICT office                    |             |\n| 10      | Developer access removed (app, hosting, repository)                                 | City ICT office                    |             |\n| 11      | Signed handover record                                                              | City Mayor                         |             |\n\n## Validation and Source Control Register\n\n**Table 10.29**\n\n*Validation and Source Control Register*\n\n| **Item**                                    | **Source Used**                                             | **Status**                                             |\n|---------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------|\n| IAT rows and scores                         | IAT v1.7 workbook in the repository (12 Nov 2026)           | Pending validation, 1–4 December 2026                  |\n| A1.1 finding and Ordinance No. 008, s. 2014 | City issuances register; Chapter 1 Draft 1.3                | Score unchanged pending validation; amendment proposed |\n| Staff numbers                               | FGD (about 47 staff, four permanent)                        | HRMO to confirm from the Plantilla of Personnel        |\n| Gawad KALASAG CY 2026 rules                 | OCD Memo No. 763, s. 2026 (corrected), read 12 Nov 2026     | Confirm the regional timeline and tool with OCD VIII   |\n| SGLG criteria                               | RA 11292; current DILG MC not read                          | Obtain the current criteria each year                  |\n| MODE hosting and backups                    | ADR-002, ADR-021, ADR-026; DEPLOY.md; SECURITY.md (v1.16.0) | City decision on production hosting pending            |\n| Civil Service rules on OIC designation      | Not quoted                                                  | HRMO to cite the current rule in the succession order  |\n| Roadmap horizons                            | Proposed by this chapter                                    | For CDRRMC decision                                    |\n\n**MANUAL ANNEX**\n'
